pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: 风险与边界:三条红线(数据安全、幻觉核查、责任边界)+ 可以做 vs 必须人在回路正反对照。
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 40, 500, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        06 落地行动 · 风险与边界
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 62, 848, 38]
    content:
      style: "$h1"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        三条红线:数据不出界、数字要核验、高风险人确认
  # ---- 红线 ① ----
  - elementId: rule1-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 136, 4, 54]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: rule1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 138, 34, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        ①
  - elementId: rule1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 138, 160, 24]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        数据安全
  - elementId: rule1-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 164, 792, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        客户监测数据不出授权边界;调用外部模型前先脱敏,敏感字段不进入提示词。
  # ---- 红线 ② ----
  - elementId: rule2-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 200, 4, 54]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: rule2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 202, 34, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        ②
  - elementId: rule2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 202, 160, 24]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        幻觉核查
  - elementId: rule2-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 228, 792, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        对外发出的每个数字、每条事实必须人工核验——模型会一本正经地给出错误答案。
  # ---- 红线 ③ ----
  - elementId: rule3-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 264, 4, 54]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: rule3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 266, 34, 26]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        ③
  - elementId: rule3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 266, 160, 24]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        责任边界
  - elementId: rule3-desc
    elementType: text
    bounds: [112, 292, 792, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        高风险动作必须人确认:对外发送、预警发布、生产写入,一律先过人、再执行。
  # ---- 正反对照 ----
  - elementId: ok-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 340, 416, 132]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleG"}
  - elementId: ok-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [76, 356, 16, 16]
    iconName: "fas:circle-check"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pine"}
  - elementId: ok-h
    elementType: text
    bounds: [102, 352, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$pine"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        可以放心派出去
  - elementId: ok-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 382, 380, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |-
        <p>· 辅助起草:方案、邮件、纪要初稿</p>
        <p>· 内部分析:数据汇总、调研简报</p>
        <p>· 值守初判:自动巡检、异常初筛</p>
  - elementId: no-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [488, 340, 416, 132]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$paleT"}
  - elementId: no-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [508, 356, 16, 16]
    iconName: "fas:hand"
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$terra"}
  - elementId: no-h
    elementType: text
    bounds: [534, 352, 300, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$terra"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        必须人在回路
  - elementId: no-list
    elementType: text
    bounds: [508, 382, 380, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.7
      align: [left, top]
      text: |-
        <p>· 对外交付:报告、方案发出前</p>
        <p>· 预警发布:地灾、墒情预警信息</p>
        <p>· 系统变更:生产写入、配置修改</p>
  # ---- 页脚 ----
  - elementId: footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [56, 502, 848, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hair"}
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 510, 640, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        东方智感 · AI 内训第三期 | 护栏共识,全员须记住
  - elementId: footer-page
    elementType: text
    bounds: [804, 510, 100, 14]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        34 / 35
